{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>AI Homework Helper 讓學生掃描或輸入作業問題，取得即時答案與逐步解說，適合需要功課輔導及概念梳理的學生。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-49.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描題目逐步解說</h2>\n<p>開啟相機掃描手寫或印刷題目，亦可直接輸入問題，系統會提供清晰答案與逐步解說，涵蓋數學、科學、英文、歷史、地理、經濟及電腦科學等主要科目。另支援四十多種語言、學習記錄與每日目標，方便重溫內容及建立穩定讀書節奏。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-1.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-2.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-3.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-4.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2436\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1125x2436bb-5.jpg\" width=\"1125\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：AI Homework Helper: Tutor AI</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/ai-homework-helper-tutor-ai/id6824160823?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener 